<title>UK: Total sets 250 million mark December 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>Total sets 250 million mark December 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TOTAL SA</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    23.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.305   PAY DATE    07.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.75	REOFFER    98.88     SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMS US/GB/FR/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    FRENCH    HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  1.925     LISTING FEE 0.50</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND SEPT.2003 BUND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
